window.products.push({"id":353019,"name":"Totally Bamboo Oklahoma State Shaped Cutting Board, Natural Bamboo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tektCm0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Celebrate life in The Sooner State with the Totally Bamboo Oklahoma State Shaped Bamboo Serving and Cutting Board. This beautifully crafted board is in the shape of the great state of Oklahoma. The board is made of sustainably-sourced Moso bamboo, which is gentler on knives than plastic and easier to clean and care for than hardwood. It also works wonderfully as a serving platter for favorite meats, cheeses and all varieties of snacks— perfect for tailgating or entertaining at home! When it’s not being used in the kitchen or at get-togethers, the Oklahoma State Board also includes a hanging hole with a hang tie for an outstanding way to show your state pride on the wall of your home or office. It is built to last and easy to care for, simply hand wash and dry the board for the best results. Whether for yourself or the Oklahoma fan in your life, this board is sure to be hit!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tektCm0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B00FDN7EQC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FDN7EQC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FDN7EQC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":353020,"name":"South Shore Versa 1-Door Storage Cabinet-Gray Maple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":186.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F-clG24fL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ideal for tight spaces short on space? This smaller multifunctional piece is just what you need and the two wicker baskets (included), sliding drawer, and three storage spaces in the Armoire Section make it highly versatile. Put it in a hallway – it’s great for keeping things organized and it won't take up too much room. Maximize your entryway storage with baskets for seasonal accessories – no more lost mittens! This piece also works in your dining room, for storing tablecloths and cookbooks. And talk about versatile – You can also use it to keep your laundry room, entryway, or any other small space organized. This piece from our Versa collection blends nicely with any contemporary decor. It’s timeless, yet modern, so it'll fit right into a room with clean lines or as a trendy accent piece in a more classic setting. The delicate top molding sets it off, and the bottom is decorated with a rounded kick plate. Both handles are made of metal: a chic knob on the drawer, and a straight handle on the Armoire Section. The door on the right is mounted on solid metal hinges, with a magnetic latch to hold it closed. So this Piece is great for storing all sorts of accessories – and you don't have to worry about the door opening on its own! The drawer, mounted on metal slides for a smooth back and forth Action, can hold up to 25 pounds. It’s great for keeping keys, restaurant menus, and bills out of sight – anything that’s usually left out in the entryway! 5-Year limited South Shore is proud to stand behind this 1-Door multipurpose storage cabinet with baskets with an exclusive 5-year limited. Shop with confidence knowing your purchase is always covered. All our products meets or exceeds North American safety standards and our packaging are tested and certified to reduce the risk of damage during shipment. This item is shipped in 1 box, make sure to have a friend with you. Assembly is required by 2 adults and tools are not included. If you have questions regarding this product or need assistance do not hesitate to Contact South Shore furniture 7 days support. This product is made in North America with laminated particleboard and MDF. Accessories not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F-clG24fL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B07QDNXGF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QDNXGF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QDNXGF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":353021,"name":"Senfour Dinosaur Party Favors Bags, 12 PCS Drawstring Bag, Party Favor Supplies Birthday Party Supplies Kid Gift Bag For Kids Party Decoration Christm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712HugLL4DL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"🦕【High quality dinosaur bags for kids】 These backpacks are made from polyester and are super strong and extremely light weight, so they don't add a lot of weight or bulk when used by children. The bags are digitally printed so they won't peel off like stickers. They are also machine washable and colorfast so they won't bleed into other fabrics or fade. You and your kids can also help nature by limiting the use of paper bags and single-use plastic bags. 🛍️【Dinosaur Drawstring bags for kids 】 These bags come in 6 different dinosaur exploration background.You get a set of 12 drawstring backpacks. The dinosaur print are their actual/real life images but with eye-catching colors and appropriate backgrounds that your child and even you will love. ✨【Durable dinosaur bags for all parties. 】The backpack is securely and the polyester fabric doesn't fray easily so it doesn't tear easily. The drawstrings are large so they won't cut into your child's skin when in use and they have heavy items inside. These bags can be used for a dinosaur themed birthday party, baby shower, or arts and crafts event you have planned. They can also be used as party favors, as storage bags for goodies and trophies. ❤️【Perfect size and adjustable 】 They are 12 x 9.8 inches to fit well to kids' backs without hitting their lower backs or bobbing around when carried and you can always adjust the strings to your preferred size. 👍【Perfect Reusable bags design 】Kids can reuse them after parties to store shoes, clothes, books, lunch box and so on. A Great Replacement for Plastic and Paper Gift Bags !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712HugLL4DL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senfour","source_asin":"B0C4F9SHTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4F9SHTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4F9SHTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
