window.products.push({"id":353109,"name":"Kawaii Sakura Cup Coaster, Decor Cup Placemat, Cute Kitchen Pot Bowl Pad Placemat, Cherry Blossom Coaster, Table Cup Mat, Flower Pattern Mug Pink Coas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JfcZDa0dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality materials: The cute sakura placemat pads are made of high-quality materials, soft and light, comfortable to the touch, not easy to scratch and deform, and can reusable. Each coaster has a diameter of 4.5 inches, which is perfect for coffee cups, teacups, milk cups, glasses, wine glasses, beer glasses, whiskey glasses, mata tea cup, cola bottles, and jugs, etc. Good protect: The thick of the kawaii cup coaster is 3.5mm, which can be used as a coaster to protect your favorite coffee table, furniture, or kitchen countertop from friction and heat, make the kitchen countertop keep away from dripping hot water, coffee and tea, and it can also reduce the noise of the cups and keep the dining table, furniture, and kitchen countertops clean. Perfect decoration: The beautiful cherry blossom petals shape design and the three-dimensional relief design make the flowers come alive, naturally elegant and romantic, very suitable for homes, offices, restaurants, bars, coffee houses, hotels or other public places, etc. This sakura desk mat can well protect and decorate your table, add fashion to your space, improve your dining experience. It's also a great sakura coaster for pots, and it is the perfect home decoration accessories. Easy to clean and store: The sakura place mat does not absorb water and can dry quickly. Just wipe off the spill, rinse with water or scrub with soap, or put it in the dishwasher for washing, and then let it air dry. The white and pink coaster can be easy to stack when not in use without taking up too much space, and the lightweight coasters are great outdoor cool drink coasters. Value package: Includes 4 sakura shapes placemat (2 white and 2 pink coasters), which can match any color scheme in your home. The kawaii sakura coaster is a very good hostess gift, birthday gift, mother's day gift, holiday gift, Thanksgiving gift, Christmas gifts, housewarming gifts, and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JfcZDa0dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FVILIPUS","source_asin":"B095WDGLPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353109","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WDGLPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WDGLPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
