window.products.push({"id":353408,"name":"Japanese Pair Maneki Neko Lucky Gold Cats Kutani Ceramic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QPngLE2pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This fortune cat is loved very much in Japan. Manekineko calls luck. Especially, Hands and Color are important. Meaning of Hand. Right hand cat brings good fortune for money! Left hand cat brings good fortune for business (call customers). Meaning of Color White:Good luck Gold:good fortune for money Red:Good health Black:Amulet Yellow:good fortune for money Blue:Academic development \"Mori\" is a Kutani-brand's special technique. This product is made by \"Deco-mori\" - one of Mori techniques that uses special paint called \"Deko\" (Deko means \"bumpy\") and has very unique sense of touch. As Mori is a very special technique and requires complex operation, the number of artisans are recently getting less and it has value as a rarity now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QPngLE2pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kutani","source_asin":"B00APT2DQU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00APT2DQU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00APT2DQU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
