window.products.push({"id":353508,"name":"Rail19 Fluted Glass Nouveau Soap Dispenser with Metal Soap Pump - Lotion & Liquid Hand Soap for Kitchen and Bathroom, 12oz (Stainless Rustic)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YCpWwTBbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"RAIL19 Fluted Glass Nouveau Soap Dispenser Rustic Stainless Soap Pump Our Fluted Glass Nouveau Soap Dispenser is reminiscent of Vintage Parisian Art Nouveau, adding a charming style sink side in the bath or kitchen. Boasting a round base with fluted glass, this sizable soap dispenser beautifully houses a generous 12 fluid ounces of your favorite liquid hand soap or lotion. This soap dispenser looks great in pairs (sold individually) and is the perfect companion to farmhouse, vintage, rustic, modern, nouveau, mid century or cottage kitchens and bathrooms. Features PERFECT SIZE Glass Soap Dispenser Stores Approx. 12 fluid oz. of your favorite liquid soap and hand lotion. GLASS BASE Fluted Glass base with an attractive style that adds elegance to the bathroom and kitchen. BEAUTIFUL PUMP Glass Soap Dispenser features a classic style real metal soap pump with stainless finish. MEASUREMENTS Soap Dispenser Measures Approx. 7 3/4 inches tall x 3 inches in Diameter with lotion pump. FILL + REFILL this refillable glass soap bottle with your Favorite Liquid Soap or Lotion and Sit Sink Side in the Kitchen or Bathroom. COORDINATE with Kitchen or Bath Fixtures for a Beautiful Touch. This dispenser also looks great on nightstands, vanities, and desks! Made of eco-friendly glass + metal pump to reduce plastic waste. DISH SOAP While you may dispense dish soap with this dispenser, please note that concentrated dish soaps such as Dawn + Palmolive made for dishes may damage the pump and are not recommended. Please dilute your dishwashing soap considerably with water to extend the life of your soap pump. Non-concentrated dish soaps and thin style dish detergent dishsoap work best.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YCpWwTBbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rail19","source_asin":"B07FK6PYNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FK6PYNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FK6PYNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
