window.products.push({"id":353574,"name":"Frozen Meat Slicer for Hotpot / Shabu Shabu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41U-VDUMYmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Why Choose us?  Sharpening control buttons for controlling the whetstones to sharpen two sides of the blade easily The adjustable plate fixed knob for fixing the adjustable plate Fixed device handle for pushing the fixed meat to slice Moving handle and the fixed device handle compose of dual handles system to slice meat effortlessly Big sliced meat exit behind the machine for sliced meat sliding out quickly Safe Operation:  ON-OFF switch with waterproof cover Blade with cover for preventing from injuries Dual whetstones with cover for safe use High Efficiency:  Brand new top-quality 530 RPM meat slicer with dual baffle plates, more stable and convenient Two baffle plates and the stainless steel fixed device with steel nails for fixing meat to slice Fast slicing speed, 530 revolutions per minute Product specifications: Power: 110V, Input 240w, output 150w, 1/4HP Blade Diameter: 12\" rotary Rotary Speed: 530 RPM Material: Durable Stainless Steel Blade & Fixed Device Overall Dimension: 19\" x 18-7/10\" x 16-1/2\" Approximate Maximum Slicing Thickness: 1/2\" (13 mm) Packing Include 2x Whetstones(one rough, one less rough) 1x Meat Slicer Machine 1x Instruction Manual Notes: For safty purpose, please read the instruction before using. This is a professional meat slicer for boneless meat. It also can slice some cheese, please make sure keep your cheese in cold storage before slicing. Otherwise, it may stick to blade when it turns soft and won't be able to be sliced.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41U-VDUMYmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEALUND","source_asin":"B01538ATMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01538ATMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01538ATMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
