window.products.push({"id":353578,"name":"FREASEIT Vacuum Sealer Bags Roll，BPA Free, 2 rolls 8\"x16.5' and 2 rolls 11\"x16.5', for food storage,Sealed meal，sous vide cooking, food sealing, micro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aTRZ3maMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is dark. The busy time of the family has passed and it is a good time for the family to have dinner together. What is happier than the sufficient, delicious, fresh and clean ingredients at this time? Please see the vacuum sealer bags carefully designed for you by FREASEIT! 1. Clean, convenient and free from odor. Whenever you need a refrigerator to refrigerate food, you can think of the chaotic storage space with tainted odor. Do you often feel a kind of annoyance? Actually, you can use FREASEIT vacuum sealer bag to seal your food for refrigeration, and put an end to all troubles. 2.Fresh-keeping. Do you doubt the fresh-keeping effect of the vacuum sealer bag rolls? At first, we also doubted whether the vacuum sealer bag can reach the fresh-keeping degree we expected. So our FREASEIT team made a test and found that they can really prolong the food quality by 3-6 times or even longer. The food quality includes the freshness, nutrition and taste of your food. 3.The excellent partner for sous vide cooking. I am also a fan of sou vide cooking, and I like to use vacuum sealer bag rolls for sou vide cooking very much because it is quick and convenient. FREASEIT's vacuum sealer bag is PBA-free and made of PE +PA food-grade materials, which makes your sou vide cooking safe and secure. 4. Applicability: They are applicable to food, such as rice, miscellaneous grains, steak, sausage, mustard, pickled vegetables, tofu, fresh (frozen) poultry, stuffing, cooked food, tea, spices, food additives/oils/cosmetics and other products that need vacuum packaging, such as flavor and color preservation. After-sales service: If you have any dissatisfaction with our vacuum storage rolls, please contact us, we are committed to creating a good shopping experience. Combination includes: Vacuum sealer bag roll: 4 rolls","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aTRZ3maMS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FREASEIT","source_asin":"B092VLFJP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VLFJP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VLFJP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
