window.products.push({"id":353664,"name":"German Pool 120V Multi-Purpose 12 Litre Halogen Cooking Pot Combining Microwave Oven, Toaster, Stewing Pot and Skillets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bKeHPXn3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"German pool strongly believes in proving its customers high quality, safe and innovative products at a reasonable price. Since the 70's, German Pool has partnered with a Germany Company to design and develop a wide range of home appliances. German Pool strives to make use of top notch German technology and high quality European made parts and components when designing new products. German Pool has also won innovative design product awards.After 30+ successful years, German Pool emerges as an International Corporation who is strong in product design, manufacturing, sales & marketing, as well as importing & exporting electrical home appliances products worldwide. German Pool is one of the most influential brands in the Home Electrical Appliances Industry in Asia. Supplied Accessories: Low Rack Low Rack Low Rack is great for cooking larger food items such as roast poultry (full size), rice casserole, vegetables, etc. Used together with the High Rack to perform double level cooking. High Rack High Rack Place food items on the High Rack so that they can be closer to the heat source. It is perfect for dishes such as skewers, barbequed meat, chicken wings, etc. Ring Extension Ring Extension Ring Extension can increase the capacity of Halogen Cooking Pot by 5 litres. It is ideal for multi-level cooking or grilling large items such as roast chicken. Plate Lifter Plate Lifter Plate Lifter is a handy tool for carrying hot food or plate in and out of the Halogen Cooking Pot with only one hand. Frying Plate Frying Plate Frying Plate is made for pan-frying fish, dumplings, rice cakes, turnip cakes, pancakes, etc.Brush on a thin layer of cooking oil or grease to achieve best frying result and prevent sticking. Baking Plate Baking Plate Baking Plate is used for baking/toasting small items such as nuts, french fries, herbs, dried fruits,etc It can be use along with High Rack during steaming in order to prevent food from dehydrating.More info on Germanpool® official website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bKeHPXn3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"German Pool®","source_asin":"B01B70X90O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B70X90O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B70X90O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":353665,"name":"Coupe French Absinthe Glass by Bonnecaze Absinthe & Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vxZmXIFwL._AC_SL1028_.jpg","description":"This reproduction glass is one of the most interesting of all antique absinthe glasses. Although it resembles a French Champagne glass, this glass was made specifically for use with absinthe. This glass is made to the same measurements as an original Coupe glass, including its reservoir. The reservoir is the bottom area of the glass used to measure the amount of absinthe to be added. Besides aiding a bartender by helping them to know the exact amount of absinthe to pour, the reservoir also helps the customer know it is an honest pour. The size of the reservoir generally correlates with the size of the glass being used, as water to absinthe ratios vary by the drinker (typically 3 to 5 parts water, to 1-part absinthe). This glass' reservoir measures 25 ml (.8 oz), which is standard for an absinthe glass of this size.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vxZmXIFwL._AC_SL1028_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonnecaze Absinthe & Home","source_asin":"B084WRF118","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084WRF118","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084WRF118","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
