window.products.push({"id":353768,"name":"Koralia Natural Slate Tray Cheese Plates for Kitchen, Serving Platter, Charcuterie Boards for Meats and Snacks, Slate Cheese Board, Display, Dining, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ng+PtZMGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 【NATURAL SERVING PLATTER】 - Our serving platter is handcrafted with genuine black slate, direct from natural charcoal! Every single slate you order will have its own unique,they aren't uniformly perfect but they aren't supposed to be! Awesome addition to hosting,the board is a solid slate slab and feels premium. ✅ 【FUNCTIONAL & VERSATILE👏】 - Serve hot and cold foods, gourmet cheeses, meats, sushi, olives, crackers, tapas, mini bites, appetizers, dips, hors d' oeuvres, desserts, and pastries; Use at home or in restaurants and cafes; ✅ 【EASY TO CLEAN】 - No dust or residue involved, and you can easily clean any drops or spills off the slate plate with a simple damp cloth, rinse and dry thoroughly. Best to coat them with mineral oil after washing for durable use.Safe for hand-wash,but do not recommend in dishwasher. ✅ 【GREAT FOR DINNER PARTY】 - Amaze your guests with this beautiful and unique natural black slate serving board. Impeccable quality and look, to display all types of foods no matter the occasion. Our large slate cheese board set also makes an amazing quarantine gift idea🎁 💯 Tips- Wipe with cooking oil before first use! Rinse the product with water after receiving the product, wipe the product with a dishcloth, and wipe the surface with cooking oil for a long time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ng+PtZMGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koralia","source_asin":"B08HM9CM4N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HM9CM4N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HM9CM4N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":353769,"name":"MARTHA STEWART Tinsel Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Tree, 5 ft, Silver/Clear Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RqSSPV8mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed by Martha Stewart exclusively for , this pre-lit glittering Silver Tinsel Christmas tree including stand measures 5 feet tall by 3 feet wide, and includes an 18 inch wide stable metal base. Constructed with a look and feel that’s festive and modern, this tree comes out of the box needing very little shaping thanks to our Memory Wire Branches. With a 628 tip-count, the silver tinsel branches create a modern Christmas Look. Our hinged branches are permanently affixed as opposed to dated and tedious individually attached branches found on many artificial trees. Vertical internal branches and a garland-wrapped pole make for minimal gaps and spaces, and the secure, self-centering one-screw-stand keep set up easy as 1-2-3. Skip right to the fun of hanging your ornaments! The tree comes prestrung with 250 clear warm white incandescent lights to create a warm and festive glow that remains lit even if a bulb is removed or broken. No more hunting for one light that shuts the whole tree down! Tree turns off and on easily with discreet inline foot pedal, and our patented “power in the pole” Instant Power Technology means that only one plug is needed to send power from the wall all the way through the tree and up to the convenient Tree Topper Plug at the top - no messy extension cords! Includes a 10ft power cord, 12 replacement bulbs, and white gloves for sprucing up your tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RqSSPV8mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTHA STEWART","source_asin":"B08MMB2Z2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MMB2Z2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MMB2Z2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
