window.products.push({"id":353875,"name":"Gabrylly Ergonomic Office Chair, Mesh Chair with Sliding Seat and Flip-Up Arms, Computer Desk Chair - Adjustable Headrest, Lumbar Support, Tilt Functi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jw+gQA2QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you're looking for a comfortable and durable office chair to complete your home office, the GABRYLLY OFFICE CHAIR is a great pick. FEATURES: 1.Ergonomic Office Chair: The high back is curved to assist back and shoulder posture, while the lower frame provides exemplary lumbar support to fit your body curve. It fits people of 5’9” tall and below. 2.Adjustable Seat Depth: Getting the right seat depth adjustment(3 IN) enables you to access support from the desk chair back, pressure will be alleviated at the ischial tuberosities and also at the knee joints. 3.Flip-Up Armrests: Folding arms offer options that you have chairs with arms or armless, whichever you like. Tuck the office mesh chair under the desk, ideal for space saving. 4.Tension Control Adjustment: The tilt tension knob underneath the seat to control the flexibility of rocking in your chair. 5.Tilt Function: 90~120° adjustment. 6.Breathable Mesh: A fully mesh seat & back that keeps you in a refreshing state for a day. With a waterfall design, the edge of the seat gradually curves down, which will likely help reduce pressure on your legs. 7.Adjustable Headrest: Easy to adjust headrest height and angle, it provides good neck support for 6~8 hours of sitting. 8.If you need a taller headrest or shorter gas lift, please e-mail us directly for part replacement. DIMENSIONS: Weight Limit: up to 300 pounds Chair Size: 25.2\"L x 25\"W x 44.5\"-52.5\"H Seat Size: 18.5\"L x 20\"W x 18.5\"-23.5\"H Backrest Size: 18.5\"W x 19\"H Armrest Size: 3\"W x 10\"L WHAT'S IN THE CARTON? Mesh Chair x 1 Screw Set x 2 User Manual x 1 1 YEAR WARRANTY: Please contact us directly via e-mail, GABRYLLY team is pleasured to assist you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jw+gQA2QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GABRYLLY","source_asin":"B07YC6R96Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-353875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YC6R96Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YC6R96Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
